NODE_ENV=development
PORT=3000
JWT_SECRET=replace_with_a_strong_random_value
BCRYPT_ROUNDS=12
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:3000
TESTXPENSE_DB_PATH=./data/testxpense.db

# Notes:
# - Copy this file to `.env` for local development and fill in real values.
# - Never commit your real `.env` to source control. Use secrets management in production.
# - CORS_ORIGIN: Comma-separated list of allowed origins in production. In dev, defaults to all origins (*).
# - JWT_SECRET: Generate a strong random value: openssl rand -hex 64
# - BCRYPT_ROUNDS: Higher = more secure but slower. 12 is a good default.